      "message": "No, we are retrying here because the vma changed from under us. I don\u0027t care if you are handling a uffd with VM_FAULT_SIGBUS and it does not matter for you. Short-circuiting like this breaks the conceptual logic that we have to retry with mmap_lock if VMA changed from under us.\n\nIf you want to optimize for VM_FAULT_SIGBUS just refactor that check you added into handle_userfault() as a separate function, call it here and if it confirms a uffd with VM_FAULT_SIGBUS case then return VM_FAULT_SIGBUS in all other cases return VM_FAULT_RETRY as before. And add a comment explaining what you are doing.",
